&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/maim-the-sky-slay-the-sun-hub&quot;&gt;Heron &amp;amp; Hound Commentary Corner:&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Hey, Egret?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Hey, Dhole.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Did you know that you&#039;re a tired amalgamation of the author&#039;s favorite character traits? That you&#039;re inherently a symbol of sacrificed originality for the sake of comfort in a new setting with new readers that aren&#039;t already exhausted with his extant characters?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;I dunno, did you know that he named you after a species of dogs?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;&lt;em&gt;What?&lt;/em&gt;&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
