				<description>


&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The following is a posting found on the Message Board in the Market Square in &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/larue-hub&quot;&gt;La Rue Macabre.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rmpostcontainer&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rmposttitle&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/local--files/component:laruepost/LaRueTitle.png&quot; alt=&quot;LaRueTitle.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rmpostmobiletitle&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La Rue Macabre&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rmpostcontent&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/la-rue-posts-willie-s-shine/Comeandgetyallshinenowyahear.png&quot; width=&quot;100px&quot; alt=&quot;Comeandgetyallshinenowyahear.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:120%;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For Sale:&lt;/strong&gt; Willie&#039;s Moonshine&lt;/span&gt; ( 10$ )&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Come and get it y&#039;all, its the best shine in La Rue! ( It&#039;s strong as gasoline, so don&#039;t go drinkin&#039; it like water or you&#039;ll find yo&#039; self sleepin&#039; on the ground ). I&#039;m at the end of the creek headin&#039; east of The Never &#039;n Not. It&#039;s gonna be the shack with the broken door out front. Ya&#039;ll be warned though. Been seein&#039; some bodys floatin&#039; in the creek lately, and I saw a big ass gator lumbering about. so bring you&#039;re gun with ya, and keep an eye out.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
