.com/local--files/malycegraves-author/fromluxaiko.jpg" title="Sarkic-esque Smoke Deity" alt="Sarkic-esque Smoke Deity" width="400px" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-5" style="display:none"></div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4916887&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605946185" alt="MalyceGraves" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4916887)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" >MalyceGraves</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-637629-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. Also, my 50th page on the wiki!</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-637629-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. I also manage the <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/sarkicism-hub">Sarkicism Hub</a>, but as I didn't write it, I'll not include it here.</div> </div> 
