&lt;div class=&quot;userblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;user-name&quot;&gt;CLETHOS&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;msg-time&quot;&gt;Today at 12:28 AM&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;brick actually had a modicum of intelligence.&lt;br /&gt;
