					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div style="text-align: center;"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/memoria-adytum/memoriabanner.jpg" alt="memoriabanner.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <span style="font-family: 'Nanum Brush Script', cursive; color: #390000;font-size: 450%;"><strong>In Memoria, Adytum</strong></span></div> <div class="type1"> <p><sup>5</sup>&#8230;and Ion stood amidst the smouldering ruin that was the gateway to the city of Kythera. Once more in the guise of a man, humbled before the ravages wrought in His name. He looked about Him and saw the suffering of those He once wished freed and realized that it was by His hand that their great works had been laid low.<br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> He looked upon them and wept.<br /></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><span style="font-family:var(--body-font); font-size: calc(var(--base-font-size) * 1.00); color: #000000;">- <em>The Book of the Fall, 13:5; The Solomonari</em> Valkzaron</span></p> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:80%;">╡<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/sarkicism-hub">Sarkicism Hub</a>╞</span></p> </div> <h3><span>Prologue: <span style="font-family: 'Nanum Brush Script', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 120%"><em>In Principio Erat Verbum</em></span></span></h3> <p><span style="font-size:80%;">Foundation Threat Awareness: <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[&#32;|&#32;|&#32;|&#32;|&#32;]</span></span></p> <ul> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-2095">SCP-2095: The Siege of Gyaros</a> <em>by Metaphysician</em></li> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-2480">SCP-2480: An Unfinished Ritual</a> <em>by Metaphysician</em></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/mother-who-demands-ones-toes">Karcist Halyna Ieva, or The Mother Who Demands One's Toes</a> <em>by naepicfael &amp; TheMightyMcB</em></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/lovataar-throne">Of Lovataar and the Throne</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/poisoned-honey">Poisoned Honey</a> <em>by OriCat</em></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/nadox-and-the-mekhanite">Nadox &amp; The Mekhanite</a> <em>by Metaphycian and Uranium Empire</em></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/i-say-this-that-you-suffer">i say this that you suffer</a> <em>by OriCat</em></li> </ul> <hr /> <h3><span>Act One: <span style="font-family: 'Nanum Brush Script', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 120%"><em>Et Ecce Equus Pallidus</em></span></span></h3> <p><span style="font-size:80%;">Foundation Threat Awareness: <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[</span><span style="color: #390000">█</span> | | | <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">]</span></span></p> <h5><span><em>Principalius</em> - <span style="font-size:75%;">The Main Arc</span></span></h5> <ul> <li>Morbus - <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-3862">SCP-3862: The Gentleman Karcist</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> <li>Bellum - <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/another-soul-joins-the-halkost">Another Soul Joins the Halkost</a> <em>by TheMightyMcB</em></li> <li>Famis - <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-4786">SCP-4786: The Mouth that Hungers</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> <li>Morte - <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/anthropological-report-darkwater">Case Study 03: The Darkwater Lodge</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> </ul> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/et-ecce">Et Ecce Equus Pallidus</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> </ul> <h5><span><em>Assistentes</em> - <span style="font-size:75%;">Supplemental Stories</span></span></h5> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-4476">SCP-4476: La Famille Natau</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-2408">SCP-2408: Orok's Fall</a> <em>by Metaphysician</em></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-4197">SCP-4197: Hollow</a> <em>by Dyslexion</em></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/lance-and-bernard-s-culinary-capers">Lance and Bernard's Culinary Capers</a> <em>by Dyslexion</em></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/mornings">Mornings Are Sometimes Like That</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> </ul> <h5><span><em>Finis</em> - <span style="font-size:75%;">The Final Scene</span></span></h5> <ul> <li>Imperator Mundi - <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-3911">SCP-3911: The Thorn of God</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> </ul> <hr /> <h3><span>Act Two: <span style="font-family: 'Nanum Brush Script', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 120%;"><em>Exierunt ut Vinceret</em></span></span></h3> <p><span style="font-size:80%;">Foundation Threat Awareness: <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[</span><span style="color: #390000">██</span> | | <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">]</span></span></p> <h5><span><em>Principalius</em> - <span style="font-size:75%;">The Main Arc</span></span></h5> <ul> <li>Morbus - <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5862">SCP-5862: Faulkner's Wake</a> <em>by MalyceGraves &amp; cybersqyd</em></li> <li>Famis - <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/patience">Patience</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> <li>Morte - <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2834">SCP-2834: The Blood of MEKHANE</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> </ul> <h5><span><em>Assistentes</em> - <span style="font-size:75%;">Supplemental Stories</span></span></h5> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-5207">SCP-5207: Fit for the King</a> <em>by MalyceGraves &amp; DrAkimoto</em></li> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-5407">SCP-5407: &quot;нектар&quot;</a> <em>by DrAkimoto</em></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/regarding-scp-5862">Re: 5862 (Supplemental)</a> <em>by MalyceGraves &amp; cybersqyd</em></li> <li><a href="http://scpwiki.com/kelipat">Kelipat Nogah</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5038">SCP-5038: La Rue Macabre is CLOSED</a> <em>by MalyceGraves and plaidypus</em></li> </ul> <h5><span><