&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tab-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These next couple of tabs are an in-depth look at Ad Astra Per Aspera&#039;s lore, intended to inform prospective writers and lore junkies about what the canon has to offer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bear in mind that &lt;span class=&quot;h-span&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;none of this is required reading for the canon.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; If you only want to casually read the canon you can safely ignore this section (&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Misc.&lt;/span&gt; tab may come in handy at times, though), unless you want a closer look at the canon&#039;s world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The next tabs are on:&lt;/p&gt;
