&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-435100-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. See Experiment 5517/EX.07.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-435100-5&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;5&lt;/a&gt;. Translated from Portuguese to &#039;&#039;Lúcia Lebedev and her little angel&#039;&#039;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-435100-6&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;6&lt;/a&gt;. A dragon they wanted to make of him in life.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-435100-7&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;7&lt;/a&gt;. A mighty king I will make of him in death.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-435100-8&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;8&lt;/a&gt;. By the grace of the Great Ion.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
